  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1302.05 Diagnostic and feasibility study",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1302.05 “Diagnostic and feasibility study” means a study as contemplated by RSA 487:21, I, to identify sources of pollution to a surface water and recommend the most cost effective practices to restore or preserve water quality.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1300) #8703-A, eff 9-5-06; ss by #10696, eff 10-18-14 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1300); ss by #14186, eff 1-25-25",
